<title>UK: GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST ANDREWS, Scotland 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of</p>
<p>round-robin group matches in the Alfred Dunhill Cup world team</p>
<p>golf championship on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Group four:</p>
<p>Japan beat 7-New Zealand 2-1 (Japanese names first)</p>
<p>Naomichi &quot;Joe&quot; Ozaki 69 beat Frank Nobilo 73</p>
<p>Hajime Meshiai 73 lost to Grant Waite 72</p>
<p>Kazuhiro Takami 70 beat Greg Turner 73</p>
<p>Group four:</p>
<p>2-Australia beat Germany 3-0</p>
<p>Wayne Riley 74 beat Heinz-Peter Thuel 76</p>
<p>Greg Norman 71 beat Sven Struver 73</p>
<p>Steve Elkington 71 beat Thomas Gogele 80</p>
<p>Group one:</p>
<p>1-United States beat England 2-1 (U.S. names first)</p>
<p>Mark O'Meara 75 lost to Barry Lane 72</p>
<p>Steve Stricker 75 beat Jonathan Lomas 79</p>
<p>Phil Mickelson 72 beat Lee Westwood 73</p>
<p>Group one:</p>
<p>8-Spain beat Italy 2-1 (Spanish names first)</p>
<p>Miguel Angel Jimenez 69 beat Silvio Grappasonni 79</p>
<p>Ignacio Garrido 74 beat Emanuele Canonica 79</p>
<p>Diego Borrego 76 lost to Costantino Rocca 73</p>
<p>Group three:</p>
<p>6-Ireland beat Canada 3-0</p>
<p>Darren Clarke 76 beat Rick Gibson 80</p>
<p>Padraig Harrington 73 beat Rick Todd 73 at 19th</p>
<p>Paul McGinley 71 beat Jim Rutledge 77</p>
<p>Group three:</p>
<p>3-South Africa beat Wales 2-1 (South African names first)</p>
<p>Retief Goosen 78 lost to Phillip Price 73</p>
<p>Ernie Els 70 beat Mark Mouland disqualified</p>
<p>Wayne Westner 72 beat Paul Affleck 76</p>
<p>Group two:</p>
<p>Sweden beat 4-Zimbabwe 3-0</p>
<p>Patrik Sjoland 73 beat Tony Johnstone 76</p>
<p>Jarmo Sandelin 75 beat Nick Price 75 at 19th</p>
<p>Peter Hedblom 72 beat Mark McNulty 73</p>
<p>India beat Scotland 2-1 (Indian names first)</p>
<p>Jeev Singh 74 beat Andrew Coltart 74 at 19th</p>
<p>Guarav Ghei 78 beat Colin Montgomerie 79</p>
<p>Ali Sher 84 lost to Raymond Russell 71</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, lost, games won,</p>
<p>points):</p>
<p>Group one</p>
<p> United States   2  2  0  4  2</p>
<p> England	   2  1  1  4  1</p>
<p> Spain	     2  1  1  2  1</p>
<p> Italy	     2  0  2  2  0</p>
<p>Group two</p>
<p> Sweden	    2  2  0  5  2</p>
<p> India	     2  1  1  3  1</p>
<p> Zimbabwe	  2  1  1  2  1</p>
<p> Scotland	  2  0  2  2  0</p>
<p>Group three</p>
<p> Ireland	   2  2  0  5  2</p>
<p> South Africa    2  2  0  4  2</p>
<p> Wales	     2  0  2  2  0</p>
<p> Canada	    2  0  2  1  0</p>
<p>Group four</p>
<p> Australia	 2  2  0  5  2</p>
<p> Japan	     2  1  1  3  1</p>
<p> New Zealand     2  1  1  3  1</p>
<p> Germany	   2  0  2  1  0</p>
